        <h1>Longitudinal Career Guidance for India's Youth</h1>
        <p>Eklavya is a longitudinal career intelligence system that builds comprehensive, evolving profiles of students from age 12 through professional life. Using advanced machine learning algorithms, it matches individuals with scholarships, colleges, internships, and career opportunities uniquely aligned with their potential.</p>
